# Architecture: Collection Image Upload Flow

## Current State (Single Image)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Form
    participant H as useCreateCollection
    participant M as ImageKit Upload
    participant G as GraphQL API
    participant D as Database

    U->>F: Upload collection image
    F->>H: submit(formData)
    H->>M: uploadFile(collectionImage)
    M-->>H: imageUrl
    H->>G: createCollection(input: {imageUrl})
    G->>D: Save collection
```

## New State (Three Images - Parallel)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Form
    participant H as useCreateCollection
    participant M as ImageKit Upload
    participant G as GraphQL API
    participant D as Database

    U->>F: Upload 3 images (collection, banner, featured)
    F->>H: submit(formData)
    par Parallel Uploads
        H->>M: uploadFile(collectionImage)
        H->>M: uploadFile(bannerImage)
        H->>M: uploadFile(featuredImage)
    end
    M-->>H: {imageUrl, bannerUrl, featuredImageUrl}
    H->>G: createCollection(input: {imageUrl, bannerUrl, featuredImageUrl})
    G->>D: Save collection with all 3 URLs
```

## Data Flow

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  FORM INPUT                                                  │
│  ────────────                                                │
│  collectionImage: File │ bannerImage: File │ featuredImage: File│
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  uploadMedia() - Parallel Uploads                           │
│  ────────────────────────────────                           │
│  Promise.all([                                               │
│    uploadFile(collectionImage),                              │
│    uploadFile(bannerImage),                                  │
│    uploadFile(featuredImage)                                 │
│  ])                                                          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  RESULT                                                      │
│  ──────                                                      │
│  {                                                           │
│    imageUrl: string,                                         │
│    bannerUrl: string,                                        │
│    featuredImageUrl: string                                  │
│  }                                                           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  createCollection GraphQL Mutation                          │
│  ───────────────────────────────────────                    │
│  input: {                                                    │
│    name, symbol, description,                               │
│    imageUrl,        ← collection logo                      │
│    bannerUrl,       ← wide banner (1500x500)               │
│    featuredImageUrl ← featured highlight (1200x800)        │
│    ...                                                      │
│  }                                                           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```
